# Screenshots Directory

This directory should contain screenshots of the app for the README.

Recommended screenshots:
- home.png - Home/Welcome screen
- browse.png - Browse profiles screen
- chat.png - Chat interface
- details.png - Profile details view
- shortlist.png - Shortlisted profiles
- profile.png - User profile screen

Image recommendations:
- Format: PNG or JPG
- Resolution: 1080x1920 (mobile) or appropriate for your platform
- Keep file sizes reasonable (< 500KB per image)

